sequenceDiagram
  participant Workflow as Application workflow
  participant Bus as EventBus port
  participant Mapper as Notification mapper
  participant Telegram as Telegram adapter
  participant TG as Telegram

  Workflow->>Bus: Publish order.filled / market.paused / recovery / runtime event
  Bus->>Mapper: Curated canonical event
  Mapper->>Mapper: Select event + redact/summarize safe fields
  Mapper->>Telegram: Notification message
  Telegram->>TG: Send through @coinzilla/notifiers
  alt Delivery succeeds
    TG-->>Telegram: Accepted
  else Delivery fails
    TG-->>Telegram: Error
    Telegram->>Telegram: Log and isolate failure
  end
  Note over Workflow,Telegram: Notification delivery never changes trading state or accounting